<title>USA: Marsh Supermarkets Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Marsh Supermarkets Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>MARSH SUPERMARKETS, INC.</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			  12 Weeks Ended	  Year Ended</p>
<p>			------------------  --------------------</p>
<p>			March 29, March 30, March 29,   March 30,</p>
<p>			  1997	1996     1997(1)	1996</p>
<p>			--------  --------  ----------  ----------</p>
<p>Sales and other</p>
<p> revenues	   $328,671  $316,022  $1,451,730  $1,390,543</p>
<p>Net income (loss) $  2,123  $  1,854  $(     244) $    9,033</p>
<p>Number of shares:</p>
<p>  Primary		8,469     8,441	 8,433	 8,439</p>
<p>  Fully diluted	9,759     9,731	 9,758	 9,740 Earnings</p>
<p>(loss) per common share:</p>
<p>  Primary	   $    .25  $    .22  $(     .03) $     1.07</p>
<p>  Fully diluted   $    .25  $    .21  $(     .03) $     1.02</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q4 includes a gain of $0.10 a share from the sale of real estate.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 includes a gain of $0.14 a share from the sale of real estate.</p>
<p>(1) Earnings for the year are impacted by approximately $13.0 million pre-tax, non-recurring, non-cash charges taken in the first quarter for the adoption of FAS 121, the curtailment of the company's defined benefit pension plan, reorganization costs, and other special charges.</p>
